        "text": "terminalStress C h f t z r = heatAmplitude C (1+h) t r * deriv (radialSlice (flattening h f) t z) r + ((∫ u in Ioi r, u ^ 2 * timeResidual C h f t z u) + ∫ u in Ioi r, correction (heatAmplitude C (1+h) t) (radialSlice (flattening h f) t z) u) / r ^ 2"
